 "name": "nt_map_sepia",
 "description": "Old-map style map of the Northern Territory: sepia parchment (#d9c8a0 NT land, #c9b48a sea, brown #5a4630 ink outline, double ink frame, faint stains), the NT outline with its Top End coast, Melville/Bathurst Islands, Groote Eylandt, the Arnhem Land boundary as a dashed ink line and the Top End rivers (Victoria, Daly, Adelaide, Alligators, Liverpool, Roper, McArthur) as thin ink lines; the rest of Australia faint. No labels, rifles or animals. Equirectangular lon 125.5..141.5E, lat 10.5..26.5S at 50 px/deg, anchor (0,0) at 133.5E / 18.5S: x = (lon - 133.5) * 50, y = -(lat + 18.5) * 50. bbox x -400..400, y -400..400.",
